{
  "title": "Fibular Deficiency (anteromedial bowing)",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/pediatrics/4055/fibular-deficiency-anteromedial-bowing",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Nov 6 2025",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Fibular Deficiency is a congenital condition caused by shortening or absence of the fibula which typically presents with anteromedial bowing of the tibia and a leg length discrepancy.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made with radiographs of the tibia.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment may be observation or operative depending on degree of fibular deficiency, presence and severity of bowing, and severity of leg length discrepancy.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "three types of tibial bowing exist in children and are described based on the deformity apex",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**anterolateral bowing** (neurofibromatosis)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**posteromedial bowing** (physiologic)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**anteromedial bowing** (this topic)",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Fibular deficiency",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "consists of shortening or entire absence of the fibula",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "previously known as fibular hemimelia",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "the **most common congenital long bone deficiency**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "usually involves the entire limb",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genetics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "no known inheritance pattern",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "linked to **sonic hedge-hog gene**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**anteromedial tibial bowing**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [
                {
                  "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/4055/images/anteromedial_bow.jpg",
                  "caption": "anteromedial bow"
                }
              ],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "most common cause is fibular hemimelia",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "ankle instability",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "secondary to a ball and socket ankle",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "talipes equinovarus",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**tarsal coalition (50%)**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "absent lateral rays",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "femoral abnormalities (PFFD, coxa vara)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "developmental dysplasia of the hip",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "cruciate ligament deficiency",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "genu valgum",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "secondary to lateral femoral condyle hypoplasia",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "significant leg length discrepancy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [
                {
                  "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/4055/images/lld.jpg",
                  "caption": "LLD"
                }
              ],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "shortening of femur and/or tibia",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
